# ============================================================================
# VENDORED DEPENDENCY PROVENANCE
# ============================================================================
#
# gpsp/ is a git-managed vendored clone. Its upstream identity is pinned by:
#
#   commit : 8d268a6bb2cd799f8f2791ebb544a7ef550cfc6f
#   branch : master   (gpsp/.git/HEAD -> ref: refs/heads/master)
#
# gpsp/.git/ is excluded from this release package.
# gpsp/bios/open_gba_bios.bin is a BIOS binary and is excluded by policy.
#
# mgba/ is NOT consumed by the M16C shipping build and is excluded.
# See docs/limitations.md section 6 for the dependency evidence.
